WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
The appointment is at fourteen hundred hours.

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:05.954
Sorry, could you repeat, please?

00:00:06.204 --> 00:00:09.314
At fourteen hundred hours. Two in the afternoon.

00:00:09.564 --> 00:00:11.794
Could you speak more slowly?

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:14.919
Of course. Tuesday, at two.

00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:18.593
All right. Tuesday at two. Thank you.
